title: "The AI Incident Disclosure Shadow — reproducibility artifact"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen SHA-256-pinned inputs, and the deterministic analysis pipeline that
  regenerate every quantitative result, table, and figure in "The AI Incident
  Disclosure Shadow: An Incident-Level Study Matching AIID-Recorded AI Failures to
  U.S.-Listed Companies' Investor Disclosures, 2019-2026." Reproduction is 100%
  offline and byte-stable; it measures disclosure behavior, not compliance.
